            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c04",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 4,
              "paragraph": 121,
              "text": "“啊，对了，风信子小姐想不想跟狐狐我玩点游戏呢？要是你赢了的话我就把你放下来哟。”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c04",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 4,
              "paragraph": 124,
              "text": "“什、什么游戏？”"
            }
          ],
